        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86714, Modern Rectangular Keaton Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keaton Cabinet Pull is a modern rectangular pull that is well suited for transitional decors. It is available in a wide array of stylish finishes. The Modern Rectangular Keaton Cabinet Pull is available in an array of sizes ranging from 3-1/2 inch to 12 inch center to centers. It comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it on any lightweight door or drawer.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/keaton-finger-cabinet-pull-emtek-86713\"><b>Emtek Keaton Finger</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/keaton-appliance-pull-emtek-ap-86721\"><b>Emtek Keaton Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Emtek Keaton Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86714-specifications.pdf?v=1704262415\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek Keaton Cabinet Pull Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 7 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>86714:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86715:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86716:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86717:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>86718:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86719:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>86720:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
